//	at `path`.
//	asArchive: Download only. When true, `path` is exported as a tar stream.
//	sizeBytes: Optional total payload size. Validated against the maximum staged
//	object size (50 GiB); a larger value returns 413.
//	sha256: Optional lowercase hex SHA-256 of the full payload. If set on an
